{"pageid":1844,"title":"Candy","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Candy</span>","revid":19914,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"2023_Halloween_event\">2023 Halloween event</span></h3>\n<p><b>Candy 🍬</b> is a currency used during the <a href=\"/wiki/2023_Halloween_Event\" title=\"2023 Halloween Event\">2023 Halloween Event</a>, it is used to buy items from the <a href=\"/wiki/Ghoulish_Goods\" title=\"Ghoulish Goods\">Ghoulish Goods</a> store. It can be obtained by chopping down a <a href=\"/wiki/Hallow_Tree\" title=\"Hallow Tree\">Hallow Tree</a>, a <a href=\"/wiki/Bone_Tree\" title=\"Bone Tree\">Bone Tree</a> or a <a href=\"/wiki/Weeping_Willow\" title=\"Weeping Willow\">Weeping Willow</a> tree and by mining <a href=\"/wiki/Sweetstone\" title=\"Sweetstone\">Sweetstone</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Candycorn\" title=\"Candycorn\">Candycorn</a> and selling them to the <a href=\"/wiki/Resource_Hub\" title=\"Resource Hub\">Resource Hub</a>.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"2024_Halloween_event\">2024 Halloween event</span></h3>\n<p><b>Candy🍬</b> is a currency used during the <u>2024 Halloween Event</u>, it is used to buy items from the <a href=\"/wiki/The_Manor\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"The Manor\">The Manor</a>. It can be obtained by chopping down a <a href=\"/wiki/Hallow_Tree\" title=\"Hallow Tree\">Hallow Tree</a>, a <a href=\"/wiki/Bone_Tree\" title=\"Bone Tree\">Bone Tree</a> or a <a href=\"/wiki/Weeping_Willow\" title=\"Weeping Willow\">Weeping Willow</a> tree and by mining <a href=\"/wiki/Sweetstone\" title=\"Sweetstone\">Sweetstone</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Candycorn\" title=\"Candycorn\">Candycorn</a> and collecting <a href=\"/wiki/Pumpkin\" title=\"Pumpkin\">pumpkins</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Moon_Shard\" title=\"Moon Shard\">Moon Shards</a> to sell them in <a href=\"/wiki/Resource_Hub\" title=\"Resource Hub\">Resource Hub</a>.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"2025_Halloween_event\">2025 Halloween event</span></h3>\n<p><b>Candy🍬</b> is a currency used during the <a href=\"/wiki/2025_Halloween_Event\" title=\"2025 Halloween Event\">2025 Halloween Event</a>, it is used to buy items from the <a href=\"/wiki/The_Manor\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"The Manor\">The Manor</a>. It can be obtained by chopping down a <a href=\"/wiki/Hallow_Tree\" title=\"Hallow Tree\">Hallow Tree</a>, a <a href=\"/wiki/Bone_Tree\" title=\"Bone Tree\">Bone Tree</a>, a <a href=\"/wiki/Spider_Tree\" title=\"Spider Tree\">Spider Tree</a> or a <a href=\"/wiki/Weeping_Willow\" title=\"Weeping Willow\">Weeping Willow</a> tree and by mining <a href=\"/wiki/Sweetstone\" title=\"Sweetstone\">Sweetstone</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Catseye\" title=\"Catseye\">Catseye</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Candycorn\" title=\"Candycorn\">Candycorn</a> and collecting <a href=\"/wiki/Pumpkin\" title=\"Pumpkin\">pumpkins</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Moon_Shard\" title=\"Moon Shard\">Moon Shards</a>, or <a href=\"/wiki/Ghosts\" title=\"Ghosts\">Ghosts</a> to sell them in <a href=\"/wiki/Resource_Hub\" title=\"Resource Hub\">Resource Hub</a>.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163058\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.010 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.025 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 28/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:1844-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903163058 and revision id 19914. Rendering was